[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3561182233","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113004#issuecomment-3561182233","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113004","id":3561182233,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UQ1QZ","user":{"login":"graphific","id":10637696,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjM3Njk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10637696?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific","html_url":"https://github.com/graphific","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-21T03:35:23Z","updated_at":"2025-11-21T03:36:09Z","body":"(dont forget to put the audio on when playing :) )\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/202bbdf5-d5f9-4772-89bd-c4945c2185e8","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3561182233/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3561343548","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113004#issuecomment-3561343548","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113004","id":3561343548,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7URco8","user":{"login":"graphific","id":10637696,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjM3Njk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10637696?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific","html_url":"https://github.com/graphific","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-21T04:26:18Z","updated_at":"2025-11-21T04:26:18Z","body":"Might still add:\r\n- See the audio bus being active, the waveforms lighting up, etc like when playing a waveform in the editor\r\n- Audio now stops when changing anything in a bus. Nicer would be if audio continues and new audio parameters applied on the fly.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3561343548/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3563473737","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113004#issuecomment-3563473737","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113004","id":3563473737,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UZktJ","user":{"login":"graphific","id":10637696,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjM3Njk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10637696?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific","html_url":"https://github.com/graphific","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-21T15:20:40Z","updated_at":"2025-11-21T15:20:40Z","body":"So far only tested AudioStreamPlayers and would still like to test some more complex setups as well, but:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b54c7977-7eef-4f8d-a0ac-3c5a690a8ddd\r\n\r\n**1. LCS-Based Effect Chain Diffing**\r\nReplaced the simple \"replace all mismatched effects\" approach with a Longest Common Subsequence algorithm that preserves unchanged effects:\r\n\r\n- Before: If you had effects [Reverb, Delay, Chorus] and changed to [Reverb, EQ, Chorus], it would replace Delay→EQ\r\n- Now: Detects that Reverb and Chorus are unchanged (in LCS), removes Delay, inserts EQ at position 1\r\n- Result: Unchanged effects stay alive -> no audio glitches from unnecessary reinitialization\r\n\r\nThe LCS approach minimizes insertions/removals, keeping audio processing as stable as possible during live edits.\r\n\r\n**2. Cache to Prevent Redundant Syncs**\r\n```\r\nif (last_sent_audio_layout == layout) {\r\n    return; // Skip sending identical data\r\n}\r\n```\r\nCaches the last serialized layout in the editor. If you're just moving the mouse around without changing values, no messages are sent.\r\n\r\n**3. Compacter VU Telemetry Format**\r\nBefore:\r\n`Dictionary { \"index\": 0, \"channels\": [{\"l\": -12, \"r\": -14, \"active\": true}, ...] }`\r\nNow:\r\n`[bus_index, PackedFloat32Array[L], PackedFloat32Array[R], PackedByteArray[active]]`\r\n= 40% smaller payload, faster serialization/parsing.\r\n\r\n**4. Activity Detection from dB Levels**\r\nVU meters now derive activity from actual peak levels (> -75 dB) instead of just trusting the active flag. Prevents sticky red LEDs when audio stops playing, meters fade out naturally.\r\n\r\n**5. Framerate adaptive VU Throttling**\r\n`const int stride = CLAMP(int(round(fps / 10.0)), 1, 30);`\r\nDynamically adjusts send rate based on current FPS to maintain 10 Hz regardless of frame rate. Also skips sending when SceneTree is suspended.\r\n\r\n**6. Conditional Property Updates**\r\nEvery bus property now checks if the value actually changed before calling the setter:\r\n```\r\nif (!Math::is_equal_approx(as->get_bus_volume_db(i), want)) {\r\n    as->set_bus_volume_db(i, want);\r\n}\r\n```\r\nAvoids triggering internal AudioServer notifications for no-op updates.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3563473737/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3710713846","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113004#issuecomment-3710713846","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113004","id":3710713846,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dLP_2","user":{"login":"graphific","id":10637696,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjM3Njk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10637696?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific","html_url":"https://github.com/graphific","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-05T14:41:15Z","updated_at":"2026-01-05T14:41:15Z","body":"@AThousandShips or anyone from the Godot team: Any changes you'd like to see to this PR for it to be accepted? Thanks!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3710713846/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3716752638","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113004#issuecomment-3716752638","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113004","id":3716752638,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7diST-","user":{"login":"graphific","id":10637696,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjM3Njk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10637696?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific","html_url":"https://github.com/graphific","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/graphific/starr